{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "demand_active_demand",
  "spec": ["demand 3.3", "demand 3.4", "demand 16.2"],
  "description": "CalculateActiveDemand: base clamp, economy/tax bonus bounded by min(max*mod, demand*mod) (a negative mod picks the larger penalty), the demand cap lowering the effective maximum, negative values normalised by activeMin, ties rounded to even when posting; modifier setters do not recalculate; SimulationBegin recalculates (posting the rounded value) and then posts the truncated value; a node without min/max reports 0; the optional slew limiter (smooth) moves by 7 % of the range and stops at 0 when crossing.",
  "steps": [
